"""glassbot-backend — local AI assistant for GlassyOS.

Modes:
  glassbot-backend                    one-shot chat from stdin (read all, reply)
  glassbot-backend --ipc              long-lived JSON-line IPC for the QS widget
  glassbot-backend chat "<msg>"       one-shot chat from argv
  glassbot-backend search "<query>"   one-shot web-search-augmented reply
  glassbot-backend reset              delete all stored chats
  glassbot-backend status             check ollama
  glassbot-backend --version

IPC protocol (one JSON object per line, both directions):
  in : {"type": "boot"}
       {"type": "chat",        "text": "..."}
       {"type": "search",      "text": "..."}
       {"type": "new_chat"}
       {"type": "open_chat",   "id": "..."}
       {"type": "delete_chat", "id": "..."}
       {"type": "rename_chat", "id": "...", "title": "..."}
       {"type": "list_chats"}
       {"type": "ping"}

  out: {"type": "boot_state",    "active_id": "...", "messages": [...], "chats": [...]}
       {"type": "delta",         "text": "..."}
       {"type": "search_results","items": [...], "query": "..."}
       {"type": "end",           "search_used": false, "active_id": "..."}
       {"type": "chats_refresh", "items": [...], "active_id": "..."}
       {"type": "chat_loaded",   "id": "...", "title": "...", "messages": [...]}
       {"type": "status",        "ok": true,  "model": "...", "model_present": true}
       {"type": "error",         "msg": "..."}
"""

